  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Howell Township: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/howell-township-nj</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-howell-township-nj</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Unanimous ban on hyperscale AI data centers (100+ MW, 1M+ sq ft). 33rd NJ municipality to ban. Amendments planned to distinguish enterprise vs hyperscale facilities</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Andover Township: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
